153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (Camp Celebrate offers respite to families affected by disability through Christ-centered activities and relationships. At Camp Celebrate, individuals with disabilities and their families receive care and encouragement in a safe camp environment. Located at Carson Springs Baptist Conference Center in Newport, Tennessee, the camp provides lodging, three meals daily, fully accessible activities, and a supportive atmosphere. Families leave camp feeling refreshed, encouraged, and likely a bit tired from all the fun!)
/E (Camp Celebrate offers respite to families affected by disability through Christ-centered activities and relationships. At Camp Celebrate, individuals with disabilities and their families receive care and encouragement in a safe camp environment. Located at Carson Springs Baptist Conference Center in Newport, Tennessee, the camp provides lodging, three meals daily, fully accessible activities, and a supportive atmosphere. Families leave camp feeling refreshed, encouraged, and likely a bit tired from all the fun!)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [8]
>>
